./ ALIAS NAME=LU                                                                
)F FUNCTION -                                                                   
  The LISTUSER command lists an existing RAKF user.                             
  It lists the UserIds from the RAKF users core table with                      
  their authorities and the connected groups.                                   
                                                                                
)X SYNTAX -                                                                     
  LISTUSER userid                                                               
                                                                                
  ALIAS - LU                                                                    
                                                                                
  REQUIRED - userid                                                             
                                                                                
  RETURN CODES:                                                                 
                                                                                
     0 - The user was listed.                                                   
     8 - An error occurs. A suitable message will be given to                   
         the user.                                                              
                                                                                
  SPECIAL REQUIREMENTS:                                                         
                                                                                
     The issuing user should have the SPECIAL authority.                        
                                                                                
)O OPERANDS -                                                                   
))USERID - the user to list. 1 to 8 characters. Required, and is the            
  first and only operand. If the user don't exist, a suitable                   
  message will be displayed.                                                    
